                    <run fontcolor='#000000' fontname='Benton Sans Book' fontsize='14'> High Value customers represent 20.81% of customers but contribute 65.71% of net sales, with an average customer value of £6.04K.</run>
                    <run>Æ&#10;</run>
                    <run fontcolor='#000000' fontname='Benton Sans Book' fontsize='14'>Recommendation: Prioritize retention of High Value customers; reactivate At Risk customers; nurture Potential customers toward repeat purchase.</run>
